   "titulo": "Verbs present",
   "texto": [
    "For **διαβάζω**, the form of «He / she» is **διαβάζει**; for **γράφω**, it is **γράφει**. The termination helps to know who is speaking even if it is not called **εγώ** or **αυτός**.",
    "**Και** means «and» or «too», depending on the context. **Δεν** goes before the verb to form a denial: **Δεν δουλεύω** (I don't work)."
